  "hindi": "यही वह प्रकाश ऊपर उठता है। चारों ओर जाने वाला रथ इस द्युलोक की चोटी पर जोता जाता है। इस पर पोषण जोड़ों में तीन हैं; चौथा, मधु की मशक, उमड़ता है।",
  "english": "This very light rises up. The chariot going all around is yoked on the ridge of this heaven. On it are the nourishments, in pairs, three; the fourth, the skin-bag of honey, swells forth.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "Unclear: iyarti with ud is normally transitive ('raises'); here taken as 'rises' with bhānuḥ as subject. rapśate 'swells' (√rapś, sense uncertain). dṛti 'skin-bag'. divo asya sānavi taken as 'on the ridge of this heaven'. mithunā taken as n. nom. pl. 'in pairs' (uncertain).",
  "confidence": "low"
 },
